        "node_id": "n_7_93ba70",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2 (revised): Use a recursive approach with memoization to explore all possible ways to color the uncolored trees while keeping track of the current beauty and the total paint used. This approach ensures that we consider all valid colorings and find the one with the minimum paint usage that meets the desired beauty condition.",
